The reservation made by this order supersedes as to any of the above- described lands affected thereby the temporary withdrawal for classification and other purposes made by Executive Order No. 6910 of November 26, 1934, as amended.

This refuge shall be known as the Pathfinder Wildlife Refuge.

Executive Order No. 4860 of April 19, 1928, establishing the Pathfinder Reservation reserving certain lands within a reservoir site in Wyoming as the Pathfinder Bird Refuge is hereby revoked.

